      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ca482995-a0fc-4690-8cb7-b9640cf2e65d",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I. Why are you making me do this?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c6d2506b-a82f-4913-b28d-f0ca3d672cc8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is a loooong 🕐 project. Ideally, you will enjoy working on this project. While the content of the project will certainly factor into your enjoyment, team dynamics will play an equal part.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "80e15d0e-31c7-4ed1-a424-29fcf1c4f6a0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The purpose of this worksheet is to prime you to consider ways in which you can actively contribute to your team beyond just doing the tasks assigned to you. Beyond technical experience, you as a person, your life experiences, perspectives, and energy, will all contribute to your team.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "499f6a7e-088e-4a97-991f-80896fa777dd",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This worksheet also acts as a charter: a mutually-agreed-upon set of rules for team operation and “algorithms” for resolving team conflicts.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "004109c5-be0b-46f9-ad6e-96af1867fd29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "As you work with your team going forward, I want you to be mindful of being ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "inclusive",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". If you are friends with some of your teammates, be especially mindful of this, since friends tend to form subgroups. When you have an idea to share, try to address the entire group. When you need feedback, seek opinions from the entire group.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "173f9d4b-1986-4fb9-bf37-304daf0acda4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "There will naturally be louder and quieter members of your group. If someone isn’t contributing their thoughts, they may feel like they can’t get a word in edgewise or no one cares what they think (even if it seems like they are just shy from your perspective). ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ask them what they think!",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " If others interrupt, intervene and give the first person back “the talking stick,” so to speak. Think of it as ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "your",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " responsibility that everyone’s voice is heard.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "225c8dc8-9b7a-413f-a95c-ada8fb6d0cb8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "f021bf04-ca42-43e5-9262-df6acafd3dc5",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "II. Roles",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dc29fba2-dc88-4cfe-9e2d-ad18db35ad1f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your team is like an ecosystem: every team member will find a niche, or an environment where they are most energized and productive.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "8248be18-bc8c-4009-b5fd-e2e1b9c379a5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "First, I’d like you to think about your technical niche. These are areas where you think you can make substantial contributions to the product. Try to think broader than specific frameworks or languages (though you can use them to elaborate on a broader point): think about what types of problems you enjoy solving or what skills you want to get out of this class.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d52954ae-100c-48d6-a522-15c2c6e9953f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Remember there are many faces to developing a finished product: research, hardware, software, user interface design, user testing, marketing, etc.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "3eacb562-895a-4888-8446-795530761e5d",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here are some examples:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "e3ae5cb6-6469-4182-9626-b45436702098",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Since I like drawing and painting in my free time, I want to take responsibility for making sure our user interface is beautiful. I have skills in Adobe Photoshop and Illustrator, so I can also make any images or icons we need.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ed1d8029-7f92-496b-8272-9f4b0de2b39f",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I enjoy gathering tools for my toolbelt, so I want to be the first one to volunteer to learn new web frameworks and find their quirks.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "d273c366-fd47-4fad-a0d9-b825ac8230eb",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I think the web is a hellscape, and I want to stay as far away from it as possible. I will volunteer for any offline tasks, like machine learning or computer graphics.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "86902621-79c8-4a2f-a325-209c62a89413",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I’m a neat freak, so I want to make sure our code is well-organized and that my team members use proper code etiquette. I can write up a “best practices” document for our team to abide by.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "81c6bbcd-393f-4db9-ad63-2d34ac625c15",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I’m a masochist, and I want to be the one who helps my teammate track down a really tough bug they’ve been stuck on for a week.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "7f999467-480c-41cc-80b8-5dd4994729da",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Next, I’d like you to think about your personal niche. These are areas where you think you can make substantial contributions to your team.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "2f4abe86-aef6-4371-8332-92efb4ce5662",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here are some examples:",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "8d07ed29-b46e-4ffd-bf5c-dc3b683cc870",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I want to be a mediator in team disagreements or conflicts, making sure both sides are heard and a fair resolution is made.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ac52a731-b8f0-4444-a73a-d28c613c7d0a",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I want to be a source of inspiration, bringing big ideas to the table and forcing us to think outside our laptops once in a while.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c870b679-60c3-4b8b-b6dd-4d62723a028f",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I want to be the one who surprises my team by bringing pizza to our team meeting after a rough week.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "790455ff-1e8a-4587-9e5e-670dc186323a",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I want to be a ghost, quiet for most of the day but reliably haunting the repo with my contributions.",
          "styles": {
            "italic": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "9beedb99-109c-4ca2-b623-2ed60259008a",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Copy the form and fill it out for yourself! We’ll add these to the ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "https://cs98.me/projects/milestones/group-dynamics-worksheet#part-b",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Part B",
              "styles": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " after you are done.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
